# Legacy Cursor compatibility
# Canonical instructions live in AGENTS.md and .cursor/rules/*.mdc.

Read the nearest AGENTS.md before editing.
Inspect the implementation before proposing changes.
Prefer the smallest coherent change and avoid unrelated refactors.
Keep Flutter, WebSocket, Firebase, and Python contract participants synchronized.
Never let Flutter own the webcam; the Python backend owns camera capture and CV.
Run relevant verification and report commands actually executed, failures, and unverified behavior.
Never claim a test passed unless it was run and observed.
